		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=18116#p18116"><![CDATA[
PhD Student Position in Computational Science and Engineering - Umeå University, Sweden.<br><br>We are looking for an exceptional PhD student to join our interdisciplinary group focusing on modeling and<br>numerical simulation of complex mechanical systems. This is a full-time position over a period of four years.<br>The PhD student will contribute to the project “Modeling and Simulation of Large-scale Granular Matter with<br>Complex Flows” aiming at developing new models, algorithms and numerical computing techniques.<br><br>The application deadline is April 16. <br><br>For further information see <br><br><a href="http://www8.umu.se/umu/aktuellt/arkiv/lediga_tjanster/313-280-10.html" class="postlink">http://www8.umu.se/umu/aktuellt/arkiv/l ... 80-10.html</a><br><br><a href="http://www.physics.umu.se/english/umit" class="postlink">http://www.physics.umu.se/english/umit</a><br><br><a href="http://www.physics.umu.se/english/research/statistical-physics-and-networks/complex-mechanical-systems/" class="postlink">http://www.physics.umu.se/english/resea ... l-systems/</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5584">nisse</a> — Mon Apr 05, 2010 5:24 pm</p><hr />
